msgstr "从 Cloudflare 删除远端隧道。需要账号证书，或具有 Account:Cloudflare Tunnel:Edit 权限的 API 令牌。此操作不可恢复。"

msgid "Optional API token"
msgstr "可选 API 令牌"

msgid "Cloudflare API Token for remote deletion"
msgstr "用于远端删除的 Cloudflare API 令牌"

msgid "Optional. Required when the current token or certificate belongs to a different Cloudflare account."
msgstr "可选。当前令牌或证书属于其他 Cloudflare 账号时需要填写。"

msgid "Continue deleting local configuration if remote deletion fails"
msgstr "远端删除失败时仍继续删除本地配置"

