msgstr "可选的隧道级 API 令牌，用于 DNS 状态、DNS 删除和远程导入。这不是隧道运行令牌。授权不会自动填写此字段。留空则使用概览页的全局 API 令牌。"

msgid "Authorization creates the account certificate (cert.pem), not a Cloudflare API token."
msgstr "授权只会生成账号证书 cert.pem，不会生成或填写 Cloudflare API 令牌。"

msgid "Use Global Certificate"
msgstr "使用全局证书"

msgid "Reuse the existing account certificate and avoid creating another Cloudflare Tunnel API Token."
msgstr "复用现有账号证书，避免创建新的 Cloudflare Tunnel API 令牌。"

msgid "Using global certificate: %s"
msgstr "正在使用全局证书：%s"

msgid "Authorization creates a new Cloudflare Tunnel API Token inside cert.pem. Reuse the global certificate for tunnels in the same account to avoid extra tokens."
msgstr "授权会在 cert.pem 中生成新的 Cloudflare Tunnel API 令牌。同一账号的多个隧道建议复用全局证书，避免产生额外令牌。"

msgid "Revoke the certificate's Cloudflare Tunnel API Token"
msgstr "撤销证书中的 Cloudflare Tunnel API 令牌"

msgid "Deletes the API token embedded in cert.pem. If this certificate is shared with other tunnels, they will lose management access."
msgstr "删除 cert.pem 中嵌入的 API 令牌。如果该证书被其他隧道共用，它们将失去管理权限。"

msgid "Cloudflare Tunnel API Token revoked"
msgstr "Cloudflare Tunnel API 令牌已撤销"

msgid "Token revoke failed: %s"
msgstr "令牌撤销失败：%s"

msgid "Token not revoked because the remote tunnel was not deleted"
msgstr "远端隧道未删除，因此未撤销令牌"

msgid "Token not revoked: cert.pem not found"
msgstr "未撤销令牌：找不到 cert.pem"

msgid "Optional. Used for remote deletion and token revocation. Required when the current token or certificate belongs to a different Cloudflare account."
msgstr "可选。用于远端删除和令牌撤销。当前令牌或证书属于其他 Cloudflare 账号时需要填写。"

msgid "The token is read from cert.pem automatically; no manual lookup is needed. Requires an API token with User:API Tokens:Edit. If this certificate is shared with other tunnels, they will lose management access."
msgstr "会自动从 cert.pem 读取令牌，无需手动查找令牌 ID。撤销需要具有 User:API Tokens:Edit 权限的 API 令牌。如果该证书被其他隧道共用，它们将失去管理权限。"

msgid "Optional. Used for remote deletion and token revocation. Required when the saved API token lacks User:API Tokens:Edit or belongs to a different Cloudflare account."
msgstr "可选。用于远端删除和令牌撤销。当已保存的 API 令牌缺少 User:API Tokens:Edit 权限或属于其他 Cloudflare 账号时需要填写。"

msgid "Used for DNS status, DNS deletion, remote import, remote tunnel deletion and certificate token revocation. This is not the tunnel run token."
msgstr "用于 DNS 状态、DNS 删除、远程导入、远端隧道删除和证书令牌撤销。这不是隧道运行令牌。"

msgid "Optional per-tunnel API token for DNS status, DNS deletion, remote import, remote tunnel deletion and certificate token revocation. This is not the tunnel run token. Authorization does not fill this field. Leave empty to use the global API token."
msgstr "可选的隧道级 API 令牌，用于 DNS 状态、DNS 删除、远程导入、远端隧道删除和证书令牌撤销。这不是隧道运行令牌。授权不会自动填写此字段。留空则使用概览页的全局 API 令牌。"

